 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "scen210.0000",
   "jp": "",
   "en": "",
   "term": "null"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0001",
   "jp": "警報",
   "en": "Alarm",
   "term": "null",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0002",
   "jp": "{v:0022}ロック解除行動を察知。{p}{v:0023}時間内に解除しない場合、違法侵入者として判断し、{n}このフロアーごと爆破します。{p}{v:0024}マジックタイマーをセットしました。",
   "en": "{v:0022}Unlocking attempt detected.{p}{v:0023}If the lock is not released within the allotted time, you{n}will be deemed unauthorized intruders and destroyed{n}along with this floor.{p}{v:0024}Magic Timer set.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0003",
   "jp": "{v:0025}お、おい、早く解除してくれ！",
   "en": "{v:0025}H-Hey, hurry up and get it unlocked!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0004",
   "jp": "{v:0026}そんなに早くは無理だ！",
   "en": "{v:0026}I can't do it that quickly!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0005",
   "jp": "{v:0027}それじゃ、爆発しちゃうの？",
   "en": "{v:0027}Then is it going to explode?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0006",
   "jp": "{v:0028}そんなぁ！{n}死にたくないよぉ！",
   "en": "{v:0028}Nooo! I don't want to die!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0007",
   "jp": "{v:0029}実は‥‥これ、持ってきてるんだけど‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0029}Actually... I brought this along...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0008",
   "jp": "{v:002A}なに、なに？",
   "en": "{v:002A}What is it? What is it?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0009",
   "jp": "{v:002B}マジックタイム停止装置‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:002B}A Magic Time Stopper...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0010",
   "jp": "{v:002C}おお、それを使えば時間が止められるんだな？",
   "en": "{v:002C}Oh! So you can use that to stop time?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0011",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:002D}あんまり使いたくないんだけどね。",
   "en": "...{v:002D}I'd rather not use it, though.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0012",
   "jp": "{v:002E}どうしてですか？",
   "en": "{v:002E}Why is that?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0013",
   "jp": "{v:002F}まだ、未完成品なんだ。{p}{v:0030}確かにこの装置を動かせば、{n}術者の掛けたスペルを探し出して、{n}時間を遅らせることができる。{p}{v:0031}けれど、探査の最中に{n}ものすごい衝撃波が発生するんだよ。{n}できれば、あの痛みは味わいたくないんだけど‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:002F}It isn't finished yet.{p}{v:0030}When activated, this device can locate the caster's{n}spell and slow down time.{p}{v:0031}But it generates an enormous shock wave while{n}searching. I'd rather not endure that pain if I can{n}help it...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0014",
   "jp": "{v:0032}ガーディアン配置完了。{n}これより、カウントダウンを開始します。",
   "en": "{v:0032}Guardian deployment complete. Beginning countdown.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0015",
   "jp": "{v:0033}‥‥ふぅっ。{FFF6}",
   "en": "{v:0033}...Phew.{FFF6}",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0016",
   "jp": "{FFF6}{FFF3}{FB00}{FFFA}{FE14}{FFF7}{FE14}{FFF4}{v:0034}やるしかないみたいだね‥‥。",
   "en": "{FFF6}{FFF3}{FB00}{FFFA}{FE14}{FFF7}{FE14}{FFF4}{v:0034}It looks like I have no choice...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0017",
   "jp": "{v:0035}装置を動かしている間は、僕のそばに来ないでくれ。{n}衝撃波を受けるからね！",
   "en": "{v:0035}Stay away from me while I'm operating the device.{n}You'll be hit by the shock waves!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0018",
   "jp": "{FFEE}自爆される前に、扉を解除しろ！{FFF1}",
   "en": "{FFEE}Unlock the door before the self-destruct activates!{FFF1}",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0019",
   "jp": "装置を使うためには、{n}扉のそばに行く必要がありそうだな‥‥。",
   "en": "Looks like I need to get near the door to use{n}the device...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0020",
   "jp": "装置停止！",
   "en": "Device off!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0021",
   "jp": "{v:0036}警告します。{n}フロア爆破まで、あと８００カウントです。",
   "en": "{v:0036}Warning. 800 counts until this floor detonates.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0022",
   "jp": "{v:0037}警告します。{n}フロア爆破まで、あと６００カウントです。",
   "en": "{v:0037}Warning. 600 counts until this floor detonates.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0023",
   "jp": "{v:0038}警告します。{n}フロア爆破まで、あと４００カウントです。",
   "en": "{v:0038}Warning. 400 counts until this floor detonates.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0024",
   "jp": "{v:0039}警告します。{n}フロア爆破まで、あと２００カウントです。",
   "en": "{v:0039}Warning. 200 counts until this floor detonates.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0025",
   "jp": "{v:003A}警告します。{n}フロア爆破まで、あと１００カウントです。",
   "en": "{v:003A}Warning. 100 counts until this floor detonates.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0026",
   "jp": "{v:0040}カウントダウン終了。{n}これより、フロアーを爆破します！",
   "en": "{v:0040}Countdown complete. Detonating this floor now!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0027",
   "jp": "{v:0041}きゃーーーっ！",
   "en": "{v:0041}Aaaah!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0028",
   "jp": "マジックタイム停止装置を起動するかい？",
   "en": "Shall I activate the Magic Time Stopper?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0029",
   "jp": "{v:003B}装置起動！",
   "en": "{v:003B}Device on!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0030",
   "jp": "{v:003D}ようし、もう一度！",
   "en": "{v:003D}All right, once more!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0031",
   "jp": "{v:003C}‥くぅぅ‥‥もう限界だ！{n}装置停止！",
   "en": "{v:003C}...Urgh... I can't take any more! Device off!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen210.0032",
   "jp": "５色のボタンがある。どれから押しますか？",
   "en": "Five colored buttons. Which will you press first?",
